fresh current binding/decoder/source comparison; no redundant full proof recompile or new mathematical credit.\", \"site_boundary\": \"Original failed build retained; no fresh successful site/rendered/copy/download QA or PURIFIED claim.\", \"source\": \"Pinned arXiv2609.06906v1 raw ec485cdad5fe140114be35eef93d19398e0cafcf21abb3fff1bdbbf462e5f94d; retained literal3.1 and unnumbered Ex9 contract, no source mutation.\", \"whole_module_covered\": \"Current complete module matches its embedded context and previous independently checked full module bytes. All four Lean/Test raw+LF footprints match prior full source freeze; all4+7 reader steps/formulas/assumptions/dependency IDs unchanged except tag.\"}",
